OL,3,GNEWSAM&S taken to court by city council
OL,4,Aover closed store
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicester City Council is taking Marks
OL,7,F& Spencer (M&S) to court over hundreds
OL,8,Fof thousands of pounds of unpaid
OL,9,Fbusiness rates linked to its former
OL,10,Fcity centre store.
OL,12,FThe retailer closed its store in
OL,13,FGallowtree Gate in August 2024 but the
OL,14,Fauthority has said it is owed #419,000.
OL,16,FCourt documents have shown the case
OL,17,Fwill be heard by Leicester magistrates
OL,18,Fon Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
