OL,3,GNEWSAM&S taken to court by city council
OL,4,Aover closed store
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, M&S told the BBC it was
OL,7,F"urgently investigating" the matter
OL,8,Fwith the council and a tenant that had
OL,9,Foccupied the store since July 2025.
